
STM8S103F3P6 Hardware Abstraction Layer
    ==============================

This repository is a study project of the HAL for
stm8s103f3p6 purchased from a electronics shop.

I try to read only original datasheets and reference
manual from the manufacturer, and write code without AI.

Tools
-----

* Language : C90
* Compilier : SDCC (Small Device C Compilier) with pedantics flags
* Build : Makefile, program ST-LINK V2, stm8sflash software, clang-format
* Text Editor : Emacs
* Coding Style : Allman


What implemented?
-----------------

* Custom assertions - error.h
* General purpose input/output - gpio.h
* Serial peripheral interface - spi.h


